    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419430/extras/2b9d8a12ed2d9d4084b508d109e2eeb3.poster.avif?t=1700931517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419430/extras/2b9d8a12ed2d9d4084b508d109e2eeb3.webm?t=1700931517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419430/extras/2b9d8a12ed2d9d4084b508d109e2eeb3.mp4?t=1700931517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survive as long as possible against the zombie horde of ZOMBIAX EVIL ! Alone or in coop mode, play as an elite soldier, arm yourself to the teeth and try to rid the whole of humanity of zombie vermin ! Become a Legend of the Resistance !<br><br>ZOMBIAX EVIL plunges players into an unprecedented global conflict! 99% of humanity has been decimated by the Coranavirus, turning human beings into horrible walking corpses. In FPS or TPS mode, survive the waves of zombies more numerous and resistant than ever !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419430/extras/6d5bf12afbdcc28a97c76df388664623.poster.avif?t=1700931517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419430/extras/6d5bf12afbdcc28a97c76df388664623.webm?t=1700931517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419430/extras/6d5bf12afbdcc28a97c76df388664623.mp4?t=1700931517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Try to find laser weapons as soon as possible to evaporate your enemies ! Whether it\u2019s small-scale map or gigantic territory, players will deploy alongside their friends in a truly immersive experience or in solo mode.  <br><br>ZOMBIAX EVIL brings players state-of-the-art gameplay, with all-new weapon handling, advanced AI system, photorealistic NANITE technology textures, new armory and other gameplay innovations that elevate this game to total immersion. <br><br>Also choose the place of your clash with the zombies; from the catacombs of Paris to the torrid deserts of Australia and California to the holy city of India &quot;Varanasi&quot;. Also includes the map: HELL ARENA.",
